 "caveats": "Factory brochures (oldcarbrochures.org scans, read as page images) now back every 1968-1971 engine except the mid-1968 428 CJ (post-dates the brochures). They correct secondary sources: 1968 390-4V = 325 hp (Over-Drive 335 typo); 1971 Cobra 351-4V is the 285-hp Cleveland. The 1968 427 appears only in the original W056 brochure. 1971 429 SCJ remains unconfirmed by any factory literature found. 'confirmed' for 1971 = NHRA + Wikipedia (engine) + factory brochure (engine + hp). torinocobra.com/Hemmings/MotorTrend remained blocked. Ranchero shares the Fairlane/Torino engine list (Ranchero brochures not checked). Page images in scratchpad/fordbrochures/orig_f*, o_perf70rev."
